    "media:imagetext": "PORTLAND\nSALEM\nEUGENE\nMEDFORD\nVANCOUVER\nSEATTLE /TACOMA\nSPOKANE\nPENDLETON\nBOISE\nELKO\nELY\nLAS VEGAS\nRENO\nSAN FRANCISCO\nOAKLAND\nHONOLULU\nSALINAS\nMONTEREY\nCRAMENTO\nSTOCKTON\nMODESTO\nMERCED\nFRESNO\n/ISALIA\nBAKERSFIELD\nSANTA BARBARA\nLOS ANGELES\nLONG BEACH\nSAN DIEGO\nSALT LAKE CITY\nGRAND JUNCTION\nDENVER\nMINNEAPOLIS /ST. PAUL\nMILWAUKEE\nSAGINAW/BAY CITY /MIDLAND\nMUSKEGON FLINT\nLANSING\nGRAND RAPID\nROCHESTER\nBUFFALO\nHARTFORD 8PRI\nELMIRA CORNING\nBOSTON\nFIELD\nPROVIDENCE\nDETROIT\nCLEVELANE\nWILLIAMSPORT\nCEDAR RAPID\nDES MOINES\nJUTH BEND.\nAKRON CANTON\nSHARON\nFORT WAYNE PITTSBURGH\nHARRISBURG\nALLENT\nNEW YORK\nNEWARK\nWN BETHLEHEM EASTON\nPHILADELPHIA\nOMAHA\nMULINE /ROCK ISLAND/DAVENPORT • DAYTON\nLINCOLN\nCOLUMBUS\nBALTIMORE\nWASHINGTON\nNEWPORT NEWS\nHAMPTON WILLIAMSBURG\nCHARLESTON\nBRISTOL JOHNSON CITY/KINGSPORT\nRICHMOND\nNORFOLK/PORTSMOUTH\nKANSAS CITY\nGREENSBORO /HIGH POINT\nWINSTON-SALEM\nRALEIGH DURHAM\nKNOXVILLE\nASHEVILLE HENDERSONVILLE\nCHATTANOOGA\nCHARLOTTE\nMEMPHIS\nHUNTSVILLE DECATUR\nATLANTA\nBIRMINGHAM\nJACKSONVILLE\nMOBILE\nNEW ORLEANS\nST. PETERSBURG\nCLEARWATER\nUnited flights are timed to the stars by the Eigin National Watch Company.\nWEST PALM BEACH\nFORT LAUDERDALE\nMIAMI\nTIME FOR HAWAII\nIS NOW!\nThere are fewer visitors in Hawaii during the so-called\n\"winter months\" so it's a time for real enjoyment. See your\nTravel Agent today and plan a trip via fast United Jets to\nthis island paradise. Now really is the time for Hawaii.\nChristmas Hint ... Give a Travel Gift to that Certain \"Someone.\"",
